  <tag code="17.3" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">17.3 - Mobilisera additionella finansiella resurser till utvecklingsl&#xE4;nderna fr&#xE5;n m&#xE5;nga olika k&#xE4;llor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">17.3 - Mobilize additional financial resources for developing countries from multiple sources.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="7.1" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">7.1 - By 2030, ensure universal access to affordable, reliable and modern energy services.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">7.1 - Senast 2030 s&#xE4;kerst&#xE4;lla allm&#xE4;n tillg&#xE5;ng till ekonomiskt &#xF6;verkomliga, tillf&#xF6;rlitliga och moderna energitj&#xE4;nster.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="7.2" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">7.2 - By 2030, increase substantially the share of renewable energy in the global energy mix.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">7.2 - Till 2030 v&#xE4;sentligen &#xF6;ka andelen f&#xF6;rnybar energi i den globala energimixen.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="7.3" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">7.3 - By 2030, double the global rate of improvement in energy efficiency.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">7.3 - Till 2030 f&#xF6;rdubbla den globala f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttringstakten vad g&#xE4;ller energieffektivitet.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="7.A" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">7.a - By 2030, enhance international cooperation to facilitate access to clean energy research and technology, including renewable energy, energy efficiency and advanced and cleaner fossil-fuel technology, and promote investment in energy infrastructure and clean energy technology.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">7.a - Till 2030 st&#xE4;rka det internationella samarbetet f&#xF6;r att underl&#xE4;tta tillg&#xE5;ng till forskning och teknik inom ren energi, inklusive f&#xF6;rnybar energi, energieffektivitet samt avancerad och renare fossilbr&#xE4;nslebaserad teknik, samt fr&#xE4;mja investeringar i energiinfrastruktur och ren energiteknik.</narrative>
  </tag>
